### Target 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/targets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com",
  "name": "해커뉴스",
  "intervalMinutes": 60,
  "contentSelector": "table.itemlist"
}

### 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/targets

### 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/targets/1

### 비활성화
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/targets/1/deactivate

### 활성화
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/targets/1/activate

### 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/targets/1